        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #13487.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1159341653\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/13487\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/13487/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/13487\">#13487</a>. It's not very obvious how you can get implicit to, or even simultaneously to/from keyframes.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cc <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/OnkarRuikar/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/OnkarRuikar\">@OnkarRuikar</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41180",
            "title": "Clarify how to achieve implicit to/from keyframes",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-17T17:58:37.000Z",
