        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">With <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3020380288\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/201\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/rari/issues/201/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/issues/201\">mdn/rari#201</a> fixed and the items in the sidebar now automatically sorted based on <code class=\"notranslate\">short-title</code> as well, we can replace the manually curated list for <code class=\"notranslate\">HTML/Guides</code> in the sidebar file with <code class=\"notranslate\">listSubPages</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Also added a tiny tweak to the <code class=\"notranslate\">short-title</code> in the cheatsheet so it surfaces to the top in the sidebar.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table role=\"table\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>With this fix</th>\n<th>Presently on prod</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/490670722-6dbb148b-e66a-42c2-8a57-a74b30917de8.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kEvero7uVURqgyEGpeXCJRRaRZ9rG44NwWVxYfV1-EQ\"><img width=\"332\" height=\"584\" alt=\"html sidebar with listSubPages\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/490670722-6dbb148b-e66a-42c2-8a57-a74b30917de8.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kEvero7uVURqgyEGpeXCJRRaRZ9rG44NwWVxYfV1-EQ\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 584px;\"></a></kbd></td>\n<td><kbd><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/490668748-18b6424b-1d76-4f49-ac8c-b2374ac3f2d8.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..FM8Q9ICkvk5vLBlqUftBZy7-XmYid07xxUN4rsFC11g\"><img width=\"281\" height=\"489\" alt=\"html sidebar using manual listing\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/23019147/490668748-18b6424b-1d76-4f49-ac8c-b2374ac3f2d8.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..FM8Q9ICkvk5vLBlqUftBZy7-XmYid07xxUN4rsFC11g\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 489px;\"></a></kbd></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>",
